OL,3,AToxic haze from Indonesia spreads to
OL,4,AMalaysia and Philippines as wildfires
OL,5,Arage
OL,6,
OL,7,FThousands of people in Indonesia have
OL,8,Fbeen admitted to hospital with
OL,9,Frespiratory infections
OL,11,FCloud-seeding and firefighting aircraft
OL,12,Foperations have been complicated by the
OL,13,Fthick haze, which is blanketing parts
OL,14,Fof the country
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/39
